*.pyc
source/tools/frame_hash.txt

# Ghidra project (LCP.rep) runtime churn -- locks, temp/backup files,
# UI state, and per-user checkout dbs. Real analysis stays tracked.
LCP.lock
LCP.lock~
LCP.rep/projectState
LCP.rep/**/tmp*.ps
LCP.rep/**/~journal.bak
LCP.rep/**/~index.bak
LCP.rep/user/**/db.*.gbf

# Rendered audio under music/psg/ is derived: the .SNG/.ORG sources plus
# source/tools/render_psg_all.py regenerate it bit-for-bit, and the register
# logs beside it are the exact trace. Keep the logs, not the ~100 MB of WAV.
music/psg/*.wav
